    <!-- Note -->
    <string name="tech_note_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="tech_note">There is no public Android API to draw while the screen is fully off (that is the manufacturer AOD). This app uses the closest supported options: an overlay that, while the phone charges, keeps a dim clock on screen in either orientation and hands the phone back on tap / power / home / wake / pick-up, plus the system screen saver where the firmware honours it. The now-playing card only appears while music actually plays.</string>

